Sval: test_cert_overrides.js expects an exception to keep its jar

cert-overrides-per-jar keeps userContextId in an exception's key, so one
added under a userContextId is taken only in that jar. Upstream's test
expects it taken in every jar, so those checks expect Sval's answer and the
rest of the file runs as upstream's.

